# Architecture — agent reference

Adapted from [bulletproof-react](https://github.com/alan2207/bulletproof-react) and Kame Homes PMA. **Vite + React SPA** (`ui/`) + **Supabase edge functions** (`supabase/functions/`).

Full map + migration log: **`docs/archive/reference/project-structure.md`**.

## Layer flow

```
shared (components/, hooks/, lib/, utils/, layouts/)
  → features/guest/ | features/dashboard/
    → routes/ (thin composition)
```

| Layer                  | Path                                  | Role                                                                 |
| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Shared UI**          | `ui/src/components/`                  | `ui/`, `branding/`, `navigation/`, `charts/`, `skeletons/`, `theme/` |
| **Shared logic**       | `ui/src/lib/`, `ui/src/utils/`        | Cross-context helpers                                                |
| **Guest features**     | `ui/src/features/guest/{module}/`     | Public flows                                                         |
| **Dashboard features** | `ui/src/features/dashboard/{module}/` | Admin / operator UI                                                  |
| **Routing**            | `ui/src/routes/index.tsx`             | Composes `guest/routes` + `dashboard/routes`                         |
| **Backend**            | `supabase/functions/`                 | Deno edge functions; `_shared/` for services                         |

## Guest modules (`features/guest/`)

| Module         | Routes                         |
| -------------- | ------------------------------ |
| `calendar/`    | `/`, `/calendar`               |
| `form/`        | `/form`, `/success`            |
| `sd-form/`     | `/sd-form`                     |
| `pay-parking/` | `/bookings/:bookingId/parking` |

## Dashboard modules (`features/dashboard/`)

| Module                                                    | Notes                                                                                    |
| --------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `bookings/`                                               | Booking workflow, shell (`AdminLayout`), Telegram, templates, settings (split over time) |
| `org/`                                                    | Multi-tenant org/property, guards, onboarding                                            |
| `property/`                                               | Property dashboard home (was top-level `features/dashboard/`)                            |
| `finance/`, `maintenance/`, `pricing/`, `inbox/`, `team/` | Property- or org-scoped admin                                                            |

## Feature folder convention

```
features/{guest|dashboard}/{module}/
├── components/
├── hooks/
├── lib/
├── pages/
└── routes/
```

Use only subfolders needed. **No barrel `index.ts` re-exports** across features.

## Import rules

1. **Path alias:** always `@/`.
2. **Shared before feature-specific:** 2+ contexts need it → `components/`, `utils/`, `lib/`.
3. **Compose at routes/pages** — avoid cross-feature component imports when possible.
4. **`bookings/` is not a junk drawer** — new domain UI belongs in its module (`finance/`, `team/`, …).

## Shared utilities

| Concern                | Path                                    |
| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| PHP currency           | `ui/src/utils/format/currency.ts`       |
| Booking date/time      | `ui/src/utils/format/bookingDisplay.ts` |
| ISO / Manila dates     | `ui/src/utils/format/dates.ts`          |
| Guest field transforms | `ui/src/utils/text/formatters.ts`       |
| Supabase client        | `ui/src/lib/supabase/client.ts`         |
| Theme                  | `ui/src/lib/theme/`                     |
| `cn()` helper          | `ui/src/lib/utils.ts`                   |

Full map: **`docs/archive/reference/project-structure.md`**.

## Public vs dashboard routes

| Context   | Layout                               | Router entry                |
| --------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |
| Guest     | `MainLayout`                         | `features/guest/routes`     |
| Dashboard | `AdminLayout` / `PropertyAdminShell` | `features/dashboard/routes` |

Legacy flat paths (`/bookings`, `/finance`) redirect via `LegacyAdminRedirect`.

## When adding a module

1. `features/guest/{name}/` or `features/dashboard/{name}/`.
2. Wire routes in parent context router.
3. Route guide in `docs/guides/routes/`.
4. Update `docs/archive/reference/project-structure.md` if structure changes.

## Don'ts

- Don't add Next.js artifacts.
- Don't put business logic only in route files.
- Don't duplicate formatters in feature `lib/`.
- Don't move shadcn `components/ui/` files.
